TIAGo robot description assets
==============================

The URDF (tiago_no_arm.urdf) and every mesh under meshes/ are derived from
the following PAL Robotics S.L. ROS 2 packages, taken from this workspace's
src/ directory and flattened with tools/generate_assets.py:

  - tiago_robot  (tiago_description)      Apache License 2.0
  - pmb2_robot   (pmb2_description)       Apache License 2.0
  - pal_urdf_utils                        Apache License 2.0

